# SRTSalesOps — Project Conventions

## What this repo is

Private internal app for Start Right Tutoring (Pierre only). Gemini research → pipeline → rate-card quote → one-tier PDF.

This is **not** the public website. Never copy prices into `/Users/pierrei/StartRightTutoringLocal/WebsiteNewLocal`.

## Stack

- Single Vite + React 18 + React Router app at the repo root
- Language: **JSX** (not TypeScript)
- Styling: Tailwind + CSS variables; alias `@/` → `src/`
- UI: shadcn/ui (New York) under `src/components/ui/`
- Icons: Lucide
- Dev server: `127.0.0.1:3001` only

## Do

- Read `docs/SPEC.md` and `docs/BUILD-PLAN.md` before adding features
- Copy prices from `docs/sales/service-tiers.md` — markdown wins if JS drifts
- Brand: **Start Right Tutoring**; navy + cyan; Space Grotesk / Inter
- Client PDF shows **one tier** and no internal scores

## Don't

- Don't add Next.js, Prisma, Stripe, HubSpot, or Outlook
- Don't call the Gemini API in v1 (paste import only)
- Don't bind Vite to `0.0.0.0` or deploy until auth exists
- Don't discount tier prices in the UI — move the client down a tier instead
- Don't put Learning / OpSRT student records in this CRM

## Commands (once scaffolded)

- Dev: `npm run dev` → http://127.0.0.1:3001
- Test: `npm test`
